Follow-ups to 0034 to 0036.
0034: a mesh pipeline without a PS keeps its color formats (they must match
the render pass) but gets write mask 0 and no blending, so nothing undefined
is written. 0035: attachment-free pipelines always use the command list's
sample count, also with ForcedSampleCount and Count 1. 0036: no branch when the
buffer has no bounds metadata, and DXIL buffer stores are guarded like loads.

